  - m_Id: 4295965603508235
    m_Localized: Unity Developer with 4+ years of cross-platform game-development
      experience. Specialized in asset integration, rendering and memory optimization,
      technical-art workflows, and production tooling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4295965603508236
    m_Localized: Experience ranges from solo feature ownership and mobile prototypes
      to large-team production on PC projects. Published Unity tools, shader assets,
      and the multiplayer game Art Guard.
