  - m_Id: 7567863393267712
    m_Localized: Open Project
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7604244526116864
    m_Localized: Welcome to My Interactive CV
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7604372116844544
    m_Localized: Explore my experience instead of reading through it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7604573586042880
    m_Localized: "This multiplayer project is an interactive alternative to a traditional
      r\xE9sum\xE9, built to showcase my experience through exploration rather than
      a static list of skills and projects."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7604841019060224
    m_Localized: "As you explore the map, you\u2019ll find project showcases, work
      experience, technical demonstrations, shader settings, external links, and
      other Points of Interest. Use the minimap in the upper-right corner and the
      directional arrow to find your next destination."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7604940742832128
    m_Localized: "Move with mouse/touch or keyboard\u2014whichever feels more comfortable.
      Other players may be exploring alongside you, but all portfolio content can
      be viewed independently."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7605041779421184
    m_Localized: Explore in any order, interact with anything that catches your attention,
      and enjoy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7606851353161728
    m_Localized: Explore the map
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7606904411107328
    m_Localized: Controls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
